A German company just built an ai chip that runs on light instead of electricity. Running today's big models gulps huge amounts of power, and that shows up on phone bills and in the climate. This is Models &amp; Agents for Beginners, Episode 240. A deep dive on the light math, cool stuff and try this, covering a shopping helper and a chatbot warning. Then quick bits. Q.ant has created, wired reports, a computer chip that does the hardest artificial intelligence or ai math as light

