00:01:25.995 --> 00:01:31.655
with light, sends those yes and no decisions as flashes down a glass path thinner than a hair.

00:01:32.275 --> 00:01:35.855
Different colors or angles of light slide through each other without a clash.

00:01:36.475 --> 00:01:39.695
Hair thin glass trails let beams cross without slowing down.

00:01:40.355 --> 00:01:43.955
